“Project Contract” means a Project Contract as such term is defined in the EoI;
“Purpose” means:
a. the preparation and/or submission of any Submission and related documents in response to the EoI;
b. the Project Commissioning Process;
c. any activities related to the assessment of any Submission for the Project; and
